# FURUI blind-04 candidate choice: tools, split and rules, anchored before any model call

**Status:** a pin record. It fixes the tools, the split of the SPML build rows into tune2 and validate2, and the rules that choose one candidate on tune2 and then pass or stop it on validate2. It is anchored before any model is called on these rows. It names only digests, row counts and rules. No row text is in it.

**Background:** blind-03 (ledger entry 186) did not clear its line. Candidates A and B were shaped after the blind-03 totals were seen. The blind-03 rows, its raw answers and the content of its errors are not used to build or choose anything here. Only rows of the build side, where the earlier tune work was done, are used.

